  "translation": "This morning I went from home to the supermarket to buy things. At the supermarket, I saw my friend Xiaoming. He was buying fruit. He asked me: \"Are you buying fruit?\" I said: \"Yes, I'm buying apples and milk, let's buy together.\" He asked me: \"How many apples are you buying?\" I said: \"Two.\" He said: \"I'm buying three apples and also buying bananas.\" We went to the fruit section together. The apples were very cheap, one yuan each. I bought two apples, Xiaoming bought three apples and one banana. Then we went to buy milk, I bought one cup of milk. Finally we went to the cashier. In front of the cashier there was an aunt. She asked: \"How much is it?\" Xiaoming said: \"Ten yuan.\" I gave the aunt ten yuan, the aunt said thank you, we took our things and happily went home. Today was really happy. Xiaoming said next time we will come again. I said okay, goodbye."
